1
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,150
[Maya, recorded message] Saved you a seat.

2
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:15,199
<i>Different cities. Different routines. Some days, we miss each other by hours.</i>

3
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:25,140
<i>In SameSky, a familiar object can hold a message for later.</i>

4
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:27,400
[Maya, recorded message] Saved you a seat.

5
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:31,100
[Maya, recorded message] The bench by the big oak, same as always.

6
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:34,500
[Maya, recorded message] Tell me about your sunset when you get home.

7
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,886
<i>A few moments become a day you can step into.</i>

8
00:01:13,133 --> 00:01:16,517
<i>Leave an answer, and it waits on the table.</i>

9
00:01:21,533 --> 00:01:27,964
<i>Share the little things, from your phone or your camera's footage, with the people you choose.</i>

10
00:01:36,633 --> 00:01:39,963
<i>A place for the moments between visits.</i>

11
00:02:00,933 --> 00:02:06,144
<i>SameSky. A place to be close, even when you're far.</i>
